marine, map, and news data — is NOT covered by the MIT license above and is
NOT redistributed under MIT. Each external data source carries its own
license and terms, which may restrict redistribution, require attribution,
prohibit commercial use, or require a separate agreement with the provider.

The authoritative per-source license table lives in DATA_SOURCES.md. Any use
of this repository that involves retaining, redistributing, or
commercially exploiting data obtained from those providers must comply with
the license of the specific source as documented there. Where a source's
